<title>PAKISTAN: HOCKEY-GOLDEN JUBILEE RESULT/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-GOLDEN JUBILEE RESULT/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result on the fourth day of the</p>
<p>Golden Jubilee of Pakistan men's hockey tournament on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Netherlands beat England 6-0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Bram Lomans 29, Marten Eikelboom 38, Rochus</p>
<p>Westbroek 55 and 69, Stephan Veen 61 and 66.</p>
<p>    Standings   P    W    D    L   F     A    PTSNetherlands</p>
<p>3 2 1 0 12 5 7</p>
<p>Germany	   2    2    0    0    4    1    6</p>
<p>Pakistan	  2    0    2    0    4    4    2</p>
<p>England	   3    0    1    2    1    9    1</p>
<p>Australia	 2    0    0    2    3    5    0</p>
</text>
